Fix shader analysis includes in builds without MILKDROP_PRESET_DEBUG.

Patch 0015 uses std::transform and std::tolower unconditionally, but added
<algorithm> and <cctype> inside the debug-logging guard. GCC fails to compile
MilkdropPreset.cpp without that flag. Include both headers in every build.

diff --git a/src/libprojectM/MilkdropPreset/MilkdropPreset.cpp b/src/libprojectM/MilkdropPreset/MilkdropPreset.cpp
--- a/src/libprojectM/MilkdropPreset/MilkdropPreset.cpp
+++ b/src/libprojectM/MilkdropPreset/MilkdropPreset.cpp
@@ -25,9 +25,10 @@
 #include "MilkdropPresetExceptions.hpp"
 #include "PresetFileParser.hpp"
 
-#ifdef MILKDROP_PRESET_DEBUG
 #include <algorithm>
 #include <cctype>
+
+#ifdef MILKDROP_PRESET_DEBUG
 #include <iostream>
 #endif
 
